---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  seoTitle="Terms of Use: Rules for Using This Website"
  subtitle="The rules for using this website"
  description={`Terms of use for ${SITE.name}: using and sharing our content, intellectual property, accuracy, liability limits, third-party links and ads, and governing law.`}
  updated="3 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Use ("Terms") apply to your use of {SITE.name} at <a href={SITE.url}>{SITE.url}</a> (the "Site").
    By accessing the Site, you agree to these Terms and to our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and
    {' '}<a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>. If you don't agree, please don't use the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Using the Site</h2>
  <p>You may use the Site for personal, non-commercial purposes. You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Copy, republish or redistribute our posts or images in full, on another website, app, channel or group, without written permission.</li>
    <li>Scrape or bulk-download content using bots or automated tools, except for search engines indexing the Site.</li>
    <li>Interfere with the Site's security or performance, or try to access parts of it that aren't public.</li>
    <li>Use the Site to mislead others, for example by presenting our content as an official notification.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Sharing is welcome</h2>
  <p>
    You're welcome to share links to our posts and quote short extracts (up to two or three sentences) with credit
    to {SITE.name} and a link back to the original post.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    Unless stated otherwise, the text, graphics, featured images, design and layout of the Site are owned by
    {' '}{SITE.name} and protected by copyright. Third-party names, logos and trademarks belong to their owners and are
    used only for identification.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Accuracy and no guarantees</h2>
  <p>
    Content is provided "as is" and "as available". We work to keep it accurate and current but don't guarantee
    that it is complete, correct or up to date, or that the Site will always be available or error-free.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its owner are not liable for any direct, indirect or
    consequential loss arising from your use of the Site or reliance on its content, including missed deadlines,
    rejected applications, fees paid, or decisions made based on our posts.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Third-party links and ads</h2>
  <p>
    The Site contains links to third-party websites and shows third-party ads. We don't control them and aren't
    responsible for their content, products, services or practices. Your dealings with them are solely between you
    and them.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Changes to the Site and Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may change, suspend or remove any part of the Site, and update these Terms, at any time. The "Last updated"
    date shows when the Terms last changed. Continuing to use the Site means you accept the updated Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the courts of India.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
